descriptions.job-14ro2fo:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;J0s5dC81iohksMxyUz8u2wpJsgb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusVUjmix2cdGPkCnX4kkwh9e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AuCBdOsCToQCeyxvP66uZugQs6c&quot;&gt;This role,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;based in Vienna (on site), Austria, is crucial in supporting our executive operations and ensuring smooth day-to-day administration. You will work closely with our Senior Executive Assistant and provide direct assistance to our Co-CEO.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8rSd5LqEoznNMxCRHMuejVgscd&quot;&gt;Your efforts will help streamline executive workflows, allowing the leadership team to focus on driving the company&#39;s strategic goals. You will be hands-on with daily logistics, meeting preparations, and cross-departmental communication, offering an excellent opportunity to learn and grow within a fast-paced corporate environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusl4ILWta6oOIoJjGZS9mUmb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusl4ILWta6oOIoJjGZS9mUmb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ATfddRctYo2KIVxRJjouR95dsWg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support the Senior Executive Assistant with daily administrative, operational, and logistical tasks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DDOQdoi7HoacqRxit1BunVZysVc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assist the Co-CEO with meeting management and follow-ups, and coordinating complex travel arrangements and events.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BjsBdR1sEoi95OxtqoLuSzRns2e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Help prepare, format, and organize materials, presentations, and documentation for board and leadership meetings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqUydVmAjovag1x5mVzuT0aXscb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Process expense reports and assist with basic internal recordkeeping and documentation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQeQdgHDmoee0WxAGHvuvFuTsvb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders to gather required information and data on behalf of the executive team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NdwpduogLozuNrxPSQ6u6ZIGsxg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assist in tracking project timelines and ensuring follow-ups on action items from executive meetings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZqDwd3wJmogK37xcZ34uXF2tsfe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as a reliable point of contact, ensuring effective and professional communication across the team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus8BoeBSVCW8k2yDoqXjFf5c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusmXEdw00ox6w704QEI9Bold&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;University degree in law, business administration, or a related field preferred (&lt;em&gt;preferred&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusJZFb9Ut0JE4LvQAsqXtf1c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At least 3 years of professional experience as executive assistant, project manager or similar role&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SwWtdjuevopx8bxQytxuFcZlsNf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A keen interest in project management or business operations, ideally with a curiosity for the financial/crypto industry.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWqydyVTeozhKqxoZ1TuUgkAsog&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent organizational skills, attention to detail, and a high degree of discretion when handling confidential information.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BjgZdKRHLo1e2SxNqvPuMB8gsIc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced international environment while maintaining a structured and analytical approach to tasks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CnLsdVjOBoM3qQxBUsHuuNBEsRc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A highly proactive mindset with a strong sense of personal responsibility and an eagerness to learn.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MTeBdJrBsoLAO0xKZKyuzbtgsGf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficiency in the Microsoft Office Suite and modern workplace collaboration tools.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TWQJdhaIToUVT8xIw1Ku1JplsEc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent communication skills; fluency in both &lt;strong&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt; is required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1gcuc0k:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We simplify wealth creation. Founded in 2014 in Vienna, Austria by Eric Demuth, Paul Klanschek and Christian Trummer, we’re here to help people trust themselves enough to build their financial freedom — for now and the future. Our user-friendly, trade-everything platform empowers both first-time investors and seasoned experts to invest in the cryptocurrencies, crypto indices, stocks*, precious metals and commodities* they want — with any sized budget, 24/7. Our global team works across different cultures and time zones, bringing our products to more than 7 million customers, making us one of Europe’s safest and most secure platforms that powers modern investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Austria but operating across Europe, our products are built by fast-moving, talented, “roll-up-your-sleeves-and-make-it-happen” kind of people. It’s these diverse perspectives and innovative minds operating as ONE TEAM that keep Bitpanda at the cutting edge of our industry. So if you’re someone who thinks big, moves fast and wants to make an impact right from day one, then get ready to join our industry-changing team. Let’s go!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Growth, Engagement &amp;amp; Retention Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you own Bitpanda’s rewards flywheel. You turn activity across our product offerings into a single measure of loyalty value, and that value into the reason a customer stays, pays, and brings others with them.&amp;nbsp;Your north star is a power user: someone deeply engaged. Revenue diversification and customer lifetime value are your measures of progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the baseline: define the core customer health metrics such as cohort retention, product attach, CLV by segment, churn drivers, and engagement depth to diagnose value leakage, size growth opportunities, and guide investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the rewards flywheel and engagement strategy: design the earning and redemption logic that connects Trading, Earn, Card, and future products through a shared loyalty currency, and map the core engagement loops across the customer lifecycle; from activation to habit, reward to reinvestment, referral, community, and status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide, based on evidence, which rewards, nudges, and growth mechanics maximize net value, evaluating reward cost, breakage, cannibalization, and cost-to-serve. Product teams own their products; you own the cross-product incentive layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore a subscription or membership model as one possible accelerator. If the evidence supports it, define pricing, tiering, and benefits for a recurring revenue layer with clear attach, retention, and margin targets; one of several mechanisms available to you, not a predetermined solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate community belonging and customer value by designing compliant, learning-focused status mechanics alongside strategic external benefits partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth, retention, and monetisation expert: &lt;/strong&gt;5+ years of Product Management in a high-growth B2C consumer platform — ideally crypto, fintech, neobank, marketplace, or loyalty/rewards. You&#39;ve shipped or scaled a subscription, loyalty, or rewards product, and you connect what makes customers loyal directly to recurring revenue and retention, understanding tiering, points economics, and the traps: breakage, cannibalization, reward fatigue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinker: &lt;/strong&gt;You can own a shared rewards ledger spanning multiple verticals without owning the verticals themselves, building connective tissue between verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack product thinker: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable across commercial/pricing design, UX, and the entitlements, ledgers, and attribution plumbing that make tiers and rewards work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven and experimentation-led: &lt;/strong&gt;You make decisions through evidence, not intuition. You define success metrics, build customer and business baselines, size opportunities, and use cohort analysis, segmentation, and rigorous A/B testing to identify value creation and leakage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear and compelling communicator: &lt;/strong&gt;You articulate commercial trade-offs to Finance as confidently as product vision to engineers, and write PRDs that leave no room for ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Flexibility to work where you thrive&lt;/strong&gt; – Enjoy the freedom of our Hybrid working model, combining onsite collaboration and remote work, with an additional 25 days per year to work from a city or country of your choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Reward for your impact&lt;/strong&gt; – Receive a competitive total compensation package aligned with Bitpanda’s pay-for-impact policy, including participation in our stock option plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Support for your mental wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt; – Access confidential coaching, counselling, and mental health resources whenever you need them through OpenUP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge&lt;/strong&gt; – On top of your standard annual leave, prioritise your wellbeing in 2027 with 3 additional days of paid time off to rest, reset, and recharge, available once you’ve been with us for 6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Continuous learning and growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Grow your skills and stay ahead in your career with unlimited access to Udemy’s library of online courses at your own pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Exclusive perks and rewards&lt;/strong&gt; – Enjoy discounts, rewards, and perks from partners worldwide across lifestyle, wellness, tech, and travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Support during life milestones&lt;/strong&gt; – Take advantage of up to 8 additional weeks of gender-neutral new parent leave to welcome and bond with your new addition to the family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Fuel and focus on-site&lt;/strong&gt; – Pandas in Vienna, Bucharest, Barcelona, and Berlin can enjoy free onsite dining, with freshly prepared lunches and snacks to keep you fueled and focused all day long.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Recognition for your contributions&lt;/strong&gt; – Celebrate milestones and achievements with recognition and rewards for your Tenure at Bitpanda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Show your Bitpanda pride&lt;/strong&gt; – Access exclusive Bitpanda-branded merchandise and gear to represent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;0 0 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Connect and celebrate with your team&lt;/strong&gt; – Join unforgettable company events, from our Winter Party in Vienna to gatherings worldwide, fostering fun, connection, and celebration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;.…and even more location-specific benefits designed to make life at Bitpanda even more rewarding wherever you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, you will have the opportunity to learn and grow as part of Bitpanda’s incredible journey towards being Europe’s future #1 investment platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bitpanda is committed to fostering a fair and equal environment based on trust and mutual respect. We believe that a diverse and inclusive workplace is paramount to our success and we are committed to building a team that represents a wide variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;* These benefits may be adjusted at Bitpanda’s discretion and do not apply to our internships and exceptions to our Hybrid Working policy apply to teams with shift schedules or for folks whose roles require them to be in-office (think: Workplaces team or IT).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0hcszmc:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Dashboard Product team is committed to providing world-class user experiences for Stripe merchants. We focus on perfecting the Dashboard Stripe’s main interface for merchants - by infusing meticulous attention to detail and craft. We take immense pride in our work and deeply care about the quality of the products we deliver. We’re dedicated to building a team with an acute focus on detail, nurturing a level of craftsmanship that makes us proud to share our work with the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We serve two core user groups. First, is real merchants using the Dashboard. We own the most critical, first-touch surfaces, such as the homepage, which we drive to set the benchmark for intuitive, reliable software. This work directly informs our second set of users, internal product teams. We distill our front-line insights into shared components and paradigms, empowering the entire organization to build a consistent, holistic Dashboard experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a mentorship-forward team where staff engineers work directly alongside early-career engineers to raise the quality bar across everything we ship. We&#39;re also actively exploring how AI agents can unlock new creative possibilities for how merchants interact with their products, and we&#39;re excited to bring that same spirit of invention to the frontend craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Frontend Engineer on the Dashboard Product team, you’ll collaborate with skilled designers and engineers to drive UX excellence in the Stripe Dashboard. You’ll craft experiences that simplify complex tasks for merchants, ensuring high performance, seamless information architecture, and intuitive discoverability. You’ll work on inventing new paradigms and elevating existing ones, with an eye toward broader use cases on the Dashboard. Working closely with designers and cross-functional groups, you’ll craft experiences that help merchants understand their business and execute essential tasks with surprising levels of ease and delight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also mentor early-career engineers to raise our collective quality bar, all while exploring how emerging AI agents can unlock new, creative ways for merchants to interact with their business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the frontend quality, consistency, and visual craft of the Stripe Dashboard&#39;s highest-traffic pages, with particular focus on core logged-in surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and execute opportunities to improve consistency, performance, and polish across the Dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Design and Product,, serving as the technical voice on frontend feasibility, quality standards, and implementation approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and advocate for the Stripe design system, ensuring components and patterns work well across the Dashboard and other product surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish frontend quality standards for the team, including patterns, code review practices, and implementation guidance for junior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype and explore AI-powered experiences that change how merchants discover and interact with Stripe products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with backend engineers on integration points while keeping frontend craft as your core focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a Staff-level role - that typically means 10+ years of experience building and shipping complex, user-facing web applications at large scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern frontend development, with strong opinions on UI quality and the ability to execute to a high level of visual precision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving measurable improvements to UI consistency and polish across large, distributed products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Design teams and translating design intent into high-quality production implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work across a large codebase and bring coherence to high-traffic product surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for crafting beautiful experiences on the web, demonstrated through a design portfolio and frontend code showcasing engaging microsites, Figma plugins, creative code, design systems, or other similar endeavors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with frontend performance engineering, including profiling, instrumentation, and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI-driven user experiences, with experience prototyping or shipping AI-powered features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring early-career engineers and contributing to team-wide quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across the full stack when needed, with a clear preference and passion for frontend craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency with React, with an emphasis on interactions, animation, performance, and refinement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with A/B testing, synthetic monitoring, or accessibility testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0s6w5lg:
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin, founded in 2017 with headquarters in Toronto, is on a mission to simplify the process and experience of buying or selling digital currencies globally. We envision bringing digital currency to the mainstream financial market through partnerships with leading corporate and franchised retail spaces. With terminals across Canada, Poland and the APAC region, including Australia, Hong Kong, and New Zealand, Localcoin is now the fastest growing Bitcoin ATM operator in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At its core, Localcoin believes that everyone should be able to own cryptocurrency and have a deep understanding of blockchain technology. As a member of our rapidly growing team, you&#39;ll join a talented, dynamic group of team members who will encourage you to learn, grow, and thrive in your career every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a self-starter looking to hone your skills in a scale up environment that fosters innovation, transparency, and team connectivity, we look forward to hearing from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hourly Range: $45 - $80&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Government Relations Professional will be responsible for supporting Localcoin’s engagement with federal and provincial and international government stakeholders, monitoring relevant policy and regulatory developments, and helping position the company as a trusted participant in the digital asset and fintech ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone with strong federal government relations experience, excellent communication skills, and the ability to navigate complex regulatory and political environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Chief Compliance Officer, this part-time position is based in Canada and requires approximately 20 hours per week. The role is likely to include occasional travel within Canada and internationally, including Australia, Europe and expansion countries, to support Localcoin&#39;s government relations, regulatory engagement, and business priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BE DOING&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with government officials, regulators, industry associations, and other key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor legislative, regulatory, and policy changes affecting cryptocurrency, fintech, payments, AML, privacy, and financial services, and share updates with internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Legal, Compliance, Product, and Operations to support regulatory initiatives and ensure business readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with external legal counsel and government relations firms across Localcoin&#39;s operating regions on government relations activities and regulatory matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review draft legislation and provide feedback to internal teams on potential business impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare briefing notes, presentations, consultation responses, correspondence, and other government relations materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Localcoin in meetings with government officials, regulators, industry groups, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with government agencies on licensing, compliance, consultations, and regulatory inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for Localcoin to participate in government consultations, industry forums, and advocacy initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory or government-related issues as they arise, including stepping in during urgent or crisis situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE’RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in federal government relations, public affairs, or lobbying, with an established network of government and regulatory contacts across Canada.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with provincial governments, particularly in Ontario, British Columbia, and Alberta, is considered a strong asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Canadian government processes, legislative procedures, and stakeholder engagement strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to prepare briefing notes, policy materials, and executive updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment, discretion, and ability to operate in a fast-moving, regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently in a part-time capacity while staying closely aligned with internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel occasionally, both within Canada and internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, financial services, payments, cryptocurrency, AML, compliance, or regulated industries is an asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network of federal and/or provincial government contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with regulators or industry associations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International government relations or regulatory experience, particularly across jurisdictions such as the European Union and Australia, is considered a strong asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in French or other languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL LOVE ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary– We value and reward our team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impactful Work – Play a key role in a growing company and make a real difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great Place to Work® Certified – Proudly recognized for our positive workplace culture and employee experience 3 years in a row.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOIN OUR INCLUSIVE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Localcoin is committed to building an inclusive, accessible, and equitable workplace. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds and do not discriminate based on race, ancestry, place of origin, color, ethnic origin, citizenship, creed, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, marital status, family status, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require accommodation at any stage of the recruitment process, please notify the Talent team or email &lt;strong&gt;careers@localcoinatm.com&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be legally eligible to work in Canada. At this time, we are not able to provide visa sponsorship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI DISCLOSURE STATEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to share that we may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to help screen and assess applications. While technology helps us stay organized and efficient, every hiring decision at Localcoin is made by real people who care about finding the best addition to our team. These tools are used to support our process—not to replace the human judgment and connection that are core to our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-06p0ck4:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;BitGo (NYSE: BTGO) is the digital asset infrastructure company delivering custody, wallets, staking, trading, financing, stablecoins, and settlement services from regulated cold storage. Since 2013, BitGo has focused on accelerating the transition of the financial system to a digital asset economy. BitGo maintains a global presence and multiple regulated entities, including BitGo Bank &amp;amp; Trust, National Association, the first federally chartered digital asset trust bank owned by a publicly traded company. Today, BitGo serves thousands of institutions, including many of the industry&#39;s top brands, financial institutions, exchanges, and platforms, and millions of investors worldwide. For more information, visit &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.bitgo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BitGo is the leader in digital asset financial services, providing institutional investors with liquidity, custody, and security solutions. Founded in 2013, BitGo pioneered the multi-signature wallet and is the first digital asset company to focus exclusively on serving institutional clients.&amp;nbsp; Active in both centralized and decentralized finance, BitGo offers market leading trading, lending, and borrowing services through its prime brokerage services and acts as the custodian for WBTC, the leading global stablecoin for Bitcoin. In 2020, BitGo launched BitGo Portfolio and Tax, providing clients with a full-stack solution for digital assets. In 2018, it launched BitGo Trust Company, the first qualified custodian purpose-built for storing digital assets. BitGo processes approximately 20% of all global Bitcoin transactions, and supports over 600 coins and tokens. BitGo provides the security and operational backbone for more than 1500 institutional clients in 50 countries, including many regulated entities and the world’s top cryptocurrency exchanges and platforms.&amp;nbsp; BitGo is backed by Goldman Sachs, Craft Ventures, Digital Currency Group, DRW, Galaxy Digital Ventures, Redpoint Ventures, and Valor Equity Partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The BitGo Prime team is a dynamic, high performing group that provides critical operational service to our institutional trading, lending, and borrowing clients in partnership with our Trust custody and compliance entity; global account managers and salespeople; and finance and accounting. Our extended unit consists of a diverse group of trading, lending, and KYC/AML professionals with extensive backgrounds in traditional and crypto-finance, including front, middle, and back office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Prime Client Services Associate will be responsible for managing business operations for BitGo Prime’s digital asset trading and financing services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage BitGo Prime’s trade and settlement workflows including trade entry, asset transfers, reporting and reconciliation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Prime’s business team to maintain optimal funding across various trading venues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First line of support for trading or financing operations related enquiries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead process improvements, identify gaps, recommend improvements and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing efforts for all enhancements of proprietary systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce daily, weekly and monthly reporting for internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Sales and Client Services team with on-boarding new counterparties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying operational risks, introduce operational controls and document policies &amp;amp; procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the product/engineering team to improve our products and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain relationships with clients, exchanges, liquidity providers and third party providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date about market trends, opportunities, risks and new projects, with a passion for the digital asset industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BitGo is looking for people who are passionate about their craft, take full ownership for their work and projects, and believe in transparent and collaborative culture with the goal of making BitGo successful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incredible attention to detail and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to effectively interact with others in a pleasant, professional manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to understand assets flows and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have previous middle or back-office experience in a financial services Trading, stock loan, FX experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and interacting with clients is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortably manage competing priorities in a fast-moving, dynamic start-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Excel or Google Sheets experience; macro programming exposure is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in financial services and cryptocurrency; crypto experience professionally or personally is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree from an accredited university, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join BitGo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disrupting an industry takes vision, innovation, passion, technical chops, drive to deliver, collaboration, and execution. Join a team of great people who strive for excellence and personify our corporate values of ownership, craftsmanship, and open communication. We are looking for new colleagues who bring innovative ways of thinking and problem solving, and who want risks to be part of the team that changes the world’s financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cryptocurrencies are the most disruptive change the financial services industry has seen in years. Join us and you’ll be able to look back and say you were part of the team that transformed investing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

