&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusigZLc6g8p1xCZfo99RyuPd&quot;&gt;The trading bot domain has emerged as one of OKX&#39;s most critical and rapidly growing sectors over the past two years. It constitutes a significant share of our platform&#39;s daily active traders and trading volume. With this swift growth, escalating user demands, and a promising future for this business, we are committed to allocating more resources to this sector. Our aim is to build top-tier products and ultimately grow this line into a billion-dollar enterprise.&lt;/div&gt;
